os/givelotus/lotus/tarball/v11.6.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/givelotus/lotus/zipball/v11.6.1","body":"## Lotus Daemon `v11.6.1` (with In-Process Chronik)\n\nPrebuilt `lotusd` and `lotus-cli` binaries for Lotus V1 mainnet, based on Bitcoin ABC `8c67fe1e85a602204a2ce65aa3b643469c2c3a1d` with the **in-process Rust/C++ Chronik indexer** compiled in (`-DBUILD_CHRONIK=ON`). Exact source and patch hashes are included in `release-manifest.json`.\n\n### Quick Start (with Chronik enabled)\n```bash\n./bin/lotusd -chronik=1 -daemon\n```\n- **Mainnet P2P**: `10605`\n- **Mainnet JSON-RPC**: `10604`\n- **Chronik HTTP / WebSocket**: `127.0.0.1:8331` (override via `-chronikbind=<ip:port>`)\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/givelotus/lotus/commits/v11.6.1"}